! NTP / SNMP / Syslog
!
! --- NTP ---
! Client mode
ntp server 10.0.0.50 prefer
ntp source Loopback0
! Server for downstream devices
ntp master 4
! Verify: show ntp status, show ntp associations

! --- SNMP ---
! v2c (community string - read only)
snmp-server community CORP-RO ro
snmp-server community CORP-RW rw
! v3 (user auth + encryption)
snmp-server user netmon NETMON-GROUP v3 auth sha SecretPass1 priv aes 128 SecretPass1
snmp-server group NETMON-GROUP v3 auth
! Notifications
snmp-server host 10.0.0.51 version 2c CORP-RO
snmp-server enable traps snmp linkdown linkup
! Verify: show snmp status, show snmp user

! --- Syslog ---
logging host 10.0.0.51
logging trap informational
logging buffered 65536 informational
logging source-interface Loopback0
service timestamps log datetime msec
! Verify: show logging
